  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Dear Nancy,


    I''m writing to you from the Music City Hotel where
    I''m staying for the weekend. (Yes, the one shaped like a guitar and yes, the
    PI firm does let me have vacation time.) My uncle is the manager here and let
    me stay for free!


    World famous magician Disappearo is performing here tomorrow
    and I have front row seats. He "stole" the priceless Diamond Guitar yesterday
    as a publicity stunt for his show but my uncle assures me the guitar is safely
    locked away in his office. Anyways, I''m off to win big at the casino!


    Cheers,

    Tasha'
